{"annotationScore": 5.0, "comments": [{"commentType": "FUNCTION", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "12933702", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "15761197", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "31326693", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "Secreted antioxidant enzyme that acts as the primary scavenger of superoxide radicals in the extracellular space, converting them to hydrogen peroxide and thereby protecting tissues from oxidative damage (PubMed:12933702, PubMed:15761197). Also preserves nitric oxide bioavailability by preventing the formation of harmful peroxynitrite (PubMed:12933702). Stored in intracellular pre-formed vesicles of macrophages and neutrophils and released upon stimulation by inflammatory mediators (PubMed:31326693)"}]}, {"commentType": "CATALYTIC ACTIVITY", "reaction": {"ecNumber": "1.15.1.1", "evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "15761197", "source": "PubMed"}], "name": "2 superoxide + 2 H(+) = H2O2 + O2", "reactionCrossReferences": [{"database": "Rhea", "id": "RHEA:20696"}, {"database": "ChEBI", "id": "CHEBI:15378"}, {"database": "ChEBI", "id": "CHEBI:15379"}, {"database": "ChEBI", "id": "CHEBI:16240"}, {"database": "ChEBI", "id": "CHEBI:18421"}]}}, {"cofactors": [{"cofactorCrossReference": {"database": "ChEBI", "id": "CHEBI:23378"}, "evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "19289127", "source": "PubMed"}], "name": "Cu cation"}], "commentType": "COFACTOR", "note": {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "19289127", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "Binds 1 copper ion per subunit."}]}}, {"cofactors": [{"cofactorCrossReference": {"database": "ChEBI", "id": "CHEBI:29105"}, "evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "19289127", "source": "PubMed"}], "name": "Zn(2+)"}], "commentType": "COFACTOR", "note": {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "19289127", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "Binds 1 zinc ion per subunit."}]}}, {"commentType": "SUBUNIT", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "16371425", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "19289127", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "Homotetramer (PubMed:19289127). Directly interacts with ATP7A; this interaction is copper-dependent and is required for SOD3 activity (PubMed:16371425)"}]}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-10195782", "uniProtKBAccession": "P08294"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "ASPH", "intActId": "EBI-12092171", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q12797-6"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-10195782", "uniProtKBAccession": "P08294"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "KCNIP1", "intActId": "EBI-22452746", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q9NZI2-2"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-10195782", "uniProtKBAccession": "P08294"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "KCNIP3", "intActId": "EBI-751501", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q9Y2W7"}, "numberOfExperiments": 6, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-10195782", "uniProtKBAccession": "P08294"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "SGTA", "intActId": "EBI-347996", "uniProtKBAccession": "O43765"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-10195782", "uniProtKBAccession": "P08294"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "SGTB", "intActId": "EBI-744081", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q96EQ0"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-10195782", "uniProtKBAccession": "P08294"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "UBQLN1", "intActId": "EBI-741480", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q9UMX0"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-10195782", "uniProtKBAccession": "P08294"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "UBQLN2", "intActId": "EBI-947187", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q9UHD9"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}]}, {"commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION", "note": {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "31326693", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "8546689", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "99% of SOD3/EC-SOD is anchored to heparan sulfate proteoglycans in the tissue interstitium, and 1% is located in the vasculature in equilibrium between the plasma and the endothelium (PubMed:8546689). In macrophages and neutrophiles, extracellular SOD2 in endocytosed and stored in intracellular vesicles (PubMed:31326693)"}]}, "subcellularLocations": [{"location": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "8546689", "source": "PubMed"}], "id": "SL-0112", "value": "Secreted, extracellular space"}}, {"location": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "id": "O09164", "source": "UniProtKB"}], "id": "SL-0266", "value": "Golgi apparatus, trans-Golgi network"}}, {"location": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "31326693", "source": "PubMed"}], "id": "SL-0498", "value": "Vesicle"}}]}, {"commentType": "TISSUE SPECIFICITY", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "31326693", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "7959763", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "Expressed in blood vessels, heart, lung, kidney and placenta. Major SOD isoenzyme in extracellular fluids such as plasma, lymph and synovial fluid (PubMed:7959763). Stored in macrophages intracellular compartments (PubMed:31326693)"}]}, {"commentType": "POLYMORPHISM", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "7662997", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "8034674", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "8546689", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "The variant Gly-231 which is found in about 2.2% of individual displays a 10-fold increased plasma EC-SOD content due to reduced heparin-binding affi